  "prefLabel": "En 1012.09 Group Study Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.09 Group Study Fee. Each applicant participating in a group study shall be responsible for its pro rata portion of the group study fee based on the export capacity of each applicant’s facility as a percentage of the total export capacity of all facilities in the group. Should one or more individual applicants of a group withdraw from the group either during the group study or after the group study has been completed and as a result of any such withdrawal, the utility shall revise or modify the group study or restudy the group impact on the distribution system, each of the remaining applicants in the group shall be responsible for its pro rata portion of the cost to revise or modify the existing group study or restudy based on the export capacity of each applicant’s facility as a percentage of the total export capacity of all remaining facilities in the group.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
